{"3970720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MUAY THAI XTREME", "steam_appid": 3970720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/5ad3675aa02ffa2a72cb73f15e477f1e.avif?t=1786339251\" width=1560 height=576 /></span>SQUADX presents <strong>MUAY THAI XTREME</strong>. The first multiplayer fighting game built entirely around Muay Thai. Authentic technique, tactical depth, and the kind of pressure you only feel in a real fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You Get, </strong>When you pick up MUAY THAI XTREME, you get:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/de1bd47dae674a4444ef6614a538b9cf.avif?t=1786339251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras_big/de1bd47dae674a4444ef6614a538b9cf.avif?t=1786339251 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked online: test your skill against fighters worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual matches: spar and train with friends, no pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies: run custom matches for your gym, crew, or community.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/09d86bbbe3c33c895a001f9989268dc2.avif?t=1786339251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras_big/09d86bbbe3c33c895a001f9989268dc2.avif?t=1786339251 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Fighting Styles</strong><br>Multiple <strong>Tactical Styles</strong> built from real Muay Thai techniques. Each one has its own strengths, combos, and ways to break your opponent down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature Mechanics</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisive Move</strong>: End the fight with one well-timed read.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weak Posture</strong>: Read the opening, land the strike, take the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corner Pressure</strong>: Lock down the clinch and own the ring.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighter Customization</strong><br>Build your fighter from the ground up. Look, gear, stance, walkout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arenas</strong><br>Fight across stadiums modelled on real Muay Thai venues, from back-alley gyms to championship rings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pre-Season: No Surrender</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in early and join the <strong>Pre-Season event</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal challenges and exclusive rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-Season cosmetics that won't come back after launch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-Season is just the opening round. On the way to full launch:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Tactical Styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More arenas and events.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper progression and career systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/1a7c61bfc4f7f2fa35b79345262e30c0.avif?t=1786339251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/